Subject: [PATCH 70/71] WIP fix-ui-6: phase 2: the stats line's hidden parts
 are .sr-only (detectors skip them, a screen reader keeps them); an untouched
 map refits when its box changes; tests: B-3 skips the docked filters (iPads
 in landscape), fix-density and UX-57 read the folded chart

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
